{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此云法時"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "戒壇即戒場，在大界\n內結。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "半月半月布薩，下至有四比丘尼，即應誦戒本。不足四人、三人、二人，當對首布薩。若\n有所犯，應先懺悔已，然後布薩。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至布薩日，若有三人，各各相向，露頂脫屣，互跪作如是言："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "五、四"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三說。後二人亦如是說。若只有二人，除上二字，即云：大姊。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "若只有一人，應心念口言："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "五、四"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三說。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "前安居四月十六日，應對一知法比丘尼言："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "若在村內，非僧住處，\n應云：某聚落。若在別房，應云：某房。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三說。\n彼應語云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "答言："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "若後安居，至五月十六日，應云：後三月。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "若無所依人對作法，即自心念口言："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三說。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "若有佛法僧事，或檀越父母等，請喚不及，即日還。若須二日，乃至七\n日，應對一比丘尼言："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三說。不應為飲食、衣物故去也。若前事不\n及七日還，當從僧乞十日、半月、一月羯磨去。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "凡有所犯，應先懺悔已，然後自恣。若住處有五比丘尼，應僧中差受\n自恣。若無五人，四人當對首，各各相向，作如是言："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三說。若有三人、二人，亦如是作。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "若只有一人，應心念口言："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三說。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "佛言：五衣應受持，有衣不受持得罪，過十日即犯捨墮。若得如法衣，應具\n威儀，對一比丘尼、或親教師、或阿闍黎，如是言："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三說。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三說。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "若干"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "若干"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "若干"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三說。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三說。佛制：恐污三衣，用覆兩肩，然後著三衣在上。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三說。厥修羅，此云篅衣，即裙也。以兩頭縫合，形\n如小篅，著時入內，擡使過臍，各蹙兩邊，雙排擪脊，繫之以絛。篅即穀圍也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "應云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三說。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三說。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即日得器，應即日受。可須用者十六枚，餘者當淨施。若遣與人，\n謂大釜、小釜、二蓋、水瓶及蓋、洗瓶及蓋、四盤、二小杓、二大杓。受云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三說。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "佛聽飲八種漿，即果汁，謂梨、棗、甘蔗、蒲萄、藕根等。應先淨人擪已，濾過澄\n清，從淨人手受。應對一比丘尼云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三說。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "酥、油、生酥、蜜、石蜜，一受得七日，自手取服，八日即施與人，自不得服。應云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三說。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "謂丸散一切鹹酸等不任為食者，一受得自取服盡，應云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三說。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "有二種淨施：一、真實施，二、展轉淨施。真實淨施，應云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "謂真實捨與他，欲要著，應問彼乃著。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "比丘尼受戒已，除五衣外，所有一切新舊衣服，對一比丘尼說淨。不\n說，過十日即犯捨墮。後凡所得衣，若布下至長一尺四寸、廣七寸，即須說淨，作如是言："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "彼受淨者應云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "受已語云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "答云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "受淨者云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "當稱一比丘尼名為淨主，或親教師、或闍黎師。若淨主死，即須別稱一淨主，將\n前所有衣物稱後淨主名說淨。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "其餘一切作法行護威儀，備載羯磨本及沙門日用中，自當檢閱。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "亦云八敬法。佛告阿難：我今為女人制八盡形壽不可過法。若能行\n者，即是受戒。何等為八？"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "餘詞如上說"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "餘詞如上。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "餘詞如上"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "餘詞如上"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "餘詞如上"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "餘詞如上"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "餘詞如上"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "云云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "終"}
